From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxim Stepanov <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 01:39:43 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] markdown: fade in streamed text while streaming

Recently appended streamed text eases in from transparent over a
configurable duration. Live-test feedback dropped the write-head glow
that originally shipped alongside the fade.
